#@DP
#@EndAlignedDisplays
#The first two parts come to @M { 0 <= l <= max(a, x) }.  When @M { Z }
#is false, the third part is @M { l >= min(b, x) }, so the set we need
#is just an interval:
#@ID @Math { dominating( x ) `` ^= ``
#lbrace l `` bar ``  max(0, min(b, x)) <= l <= max(a, x) rbrace
#@R "    if " Z = @R "false"
